WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
Here's your lunch: a sandwich.

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.810
This afternoon, it will
help power your muscles.

3
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.270
But there's a problem.

4
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.390
Food is far too big to
get into your blood.

5
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.890
Not one bite can squeeze in.

6
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.770
So how does your lunch
reach your muscles?

7
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.050
In this mission, you'll
follow food on its journey,

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.670
from your mouth, down your
oesophagus, through your stomach,

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.270
to your intestines.

10
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.990
You'll see which organs
help along the way.

11
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.190
And you'll meet enzymes,

12
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.810
and the helpful bacteria
that live in your gut.

13
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.670
Your mission: explain how a
sandwich gets from your plate to

14
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.980
your muscles.
